# The deployment root is `app/`, so only two things need to reach the builder:
# `web/` (the Next app) and `ZeroTrace Design System/` (which `web` compiles from
# source through a Turbopack alias). Everything below is either rebuilt on the
# builder or has no business leaving this machine.

node_modules
.next
*.tsbuildinfo

